id: M3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: op_sequence_properties
target: crates/core/src/session.rs
find:         &state.run.world,
replace:         if matches!(cause, Cause::Stop) { &run_before.world } else { &state.run.world },
expect-fail: properties_p1_to_p6_hold_after_every_op
note: 処理中の停止で、世界状態の変化を Changed として記録しない
